# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# U Design For The Home — environment variables
# Copy to `.env` for local development. Never commit real secrets.
# On Cloudflare, set these with `wrangler secret put <NAME>` (see DEPLOYMENT.md).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Local SQLite database used by Prisma during development.
# (In production on Cloudflare this is replaced by the D1 binding "DB".)
DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"

# Admin dashboard credentials (single admin user for now).
# Change these before deploying. The password gates /admin.
ADMIN_PASSWORD="willa2026"

# Secret used to sign the admin session cookie (HMAC).
# Generate a strong random value, e.g.:  openssl rand -base64 32
AUTH_SECRET="change-me-to-a-long-random-string"

# Optional: where booking-form notification emails should be sent once an
# email provider (Resend, etc.) is wired up. See the TODO in src/lib/email.ts.
# NOTIFY_EMAIL="udesignforthehome@gmail.com"
# RESEND_API_KEY=""
